# Quinde · API de Vuelos — colección de pruebas manuales (VS Code REST Client o JetBrains HTTP Client)
#
# Flujo completo sobre la semilla: cuenta, búsqueda, hold, reserva, boleto, equipaje, check-in,
# pase de abordar, estado de vuelo, cambio de fecha, cancelación y webhooks. Ejecuta las
# peticiones en orden ("Send Request"): cada una toma los ids de la respuesta anterior por su
# nombre (# @name). Requisitos: `./db/reset.sh` y la API arriba.
#
# Variables: cambia @baseUrl para otro entorno (Render: https://<servicio>.onrender.com/flights/v1).
# El correo del registro se genera al azar; el login usa el que devolvió el registro y el token
# sale del login.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/flights/v1
@email = manual-{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}@example.com
@password = una frase de prueba bastante larga
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
# Vuelo de mañana: el check-in abre 48 h antes de la salida
@fecha = {{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 1 d}}
@fechaCambio = {{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 2 d}}

### Salud (pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Registrar una cuenta de cliente
# @name registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Login con la cuenta recién creada: access_token (15 min) y refresh_token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{registro.response.body.$.email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 3. Perfil, roles y scopes
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Buscar UIO → GYE mañana, un adulto (pública)
# @name busqueda
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Fingerprint: coleccion-manual-01

{
  "itineraries": [{ "origin": "UIO", "destination": "GYE", "departureDate": "{{fecha}}" }],
  "passengers": { "adults": 1 }
}

### 5. Mapa de asientos del primer segmento de la primera oferta (pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/offers/{{busqueda.response.body.$.offers[0].offerId}}/seatmap?segmentId={{busqueda.response.body.$.offers[0].itineraries[0].segments[0].segmentId}}

### 6. Hold de la primera oferta en CLASSIC (cambiable): retiene el cupo 15 minutos
# @name hold
POST {{baseUrl}}/offers/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "offerId": "{{busqueda.response.body.$.offers[0].offerId}}",
  "itinerarySelections": [
    {
      "itineraryId": "{{busqueda.response.body.$.offers[0].itineraries[0].itineraryId}}",
      "cabinClass": "ECONOMY",
      "fareBrand": "CLASSIC"
    }
  ],
  "passengersBreakdown": { "adults": 1 }
}

### 7. Estado del hold
GET {{baseUrl}}/offers/hold/{{hold.response.body.$.holdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Reserva con pago aprobado (PAY-OK-): 201 CONFIRMED con boleto
# @name reserva
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "holdId": "{{hold.response.body.$.holdId}}",
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerId": "ADU1",
      "passengerType": "ADULT",
      "firstName": "Ana",
      "lastName": "Pérez",
      "documentType": "NATIONAL_ID",
      "documentNumber": "1710034065",
      "nationality": "EC",
      "birthDate": "1990-04-15",
      "gender": "F",
      "contact": { "email": "ana.perez@example.com", "phone": "+593991234567" }
    }
  ],
  "payment": { "paymentReference": "PAY-OK-MANUAL{{$randomInt 10000000 99999999}}" }
}

### 9. Consultar la reserva
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Listar mis reservas confirmadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Boletos de la reserva
# @name boletos
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Un boleto
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/tickets/{{boletos.response.body.$.tickets[0].ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Opciones de equipaje adicional
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/baggage-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Comprar una maleta adicional (otro PAY-OK-)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/baggage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "passengerId": "ADU1",
  "itineraryId": "{{reserva.response.body.$.itineraries[0].itineraryId}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "payment": { "paymentReference": "PAY-OK-MALETA{{$randomInt 10000000 99999999}}" }
}

### 15. Check-in (abre 48 h antes de la salida: el vuelo es de mañana)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Pases de abordar
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/boarding-passes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Estado del vuelo reservado (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/{{reserva.response.body.$.itineraries[0].segments[0].flightNumber}}/status?date={{fecha}}

### 18. Buscar un cambio de fecha a pasado mañana
# @name cambio
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/date-change/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "changes": [
    {
      "itineraryId": "{{reserva.response.body.$.itineraries[0].itineraryId}}",
      "newDepartureDate": "{{fechaCambio}}"
    }
  ]
}

### 19. Confirmar el cambio con la primera opción (otro PAY-OK-)
# @name cambiada
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/date-change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "changeOfferId": "{{cambio.response.body.$[0].changeOfferId}}",
  "payment": { "paymentReference": "PAY-OK-CAMBIO{{$randomInt 10000000 99999999}}" }
}

### 20. Cotizar la cancelación
# @name cotizacion
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/cancellation-quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Cancelar con la cotización: 200 CANCELLED y reembolso
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{reserva.response.body.$.bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "quoteId": "{{cotizacion.response.body.$.quoteId}}" }

### 22. Registrar un webhook (en local se acepta http://localhost; en producción, solo https)
# @name webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://localhost:4010/hook",
  "events": ["booking.confirmed", "booking.cancelled"],
  "secret": "un-secreto-compartido-largo"
}

### 23. Mis webhooks (el secreto sale enmascarado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Dar de baja el webhook
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/{{webhook.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error de referencia: sin token, 401 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
